        >
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
                <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16">
                    <div class="lg:w-1/2">
                        <h2
                            class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6"
                        >
                            Why We Started <span
                                class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-blue-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
                                >TakoVibe</span
                            >
                        </h2>
                        <div
                            class="space-y-6 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed"
                        >
                            <p>
                                The internet is full of “Hello World” tutorials. But when systems face real production challenges, require architectural clarity, or must remain reliable over time, practical guidance becomes harder to find.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                TakoVibe bridges the gap between basic tutorials and real engineering practice. We share tutorials, lessons, and core knowledge shaped by real-world experience not toy examples. We believe meaningful engineering insight comes from:
                            </p>
                            <ul class="space-y-3">
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600"></span>
                                    <span>Building and maintaining production systems</span>
                                </li>
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-600"></span>
                                    <span>Making difficult architectural trade-offs</span>
                                </li>
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pink-600"></span>
                                    <span>Running into failures and learning what actually works</span>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>
                                TakoVibe is our attempt to document those lessons openly for engineers who want to go deeper.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="lg:w-1/2">
                        <div class="relative">
                            <div
                                class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-500 to-pink-500 rounded-[2rem] opacity-20 blur-xl"
                            >
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="relative bg-white dark:bg-[#131B2E] p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-2xl"
                            >
                                <div class="text-6xl mb-6">💡</div>
                                <h3
                                    class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
                                >
                                    "We don't just write code."
                                </h3>
                                <p
                                    class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic text-lg mb-8"
                                >
