                            What Makes TakoVibe <span class="text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">Different</span>
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                            Unlike generic tech blogs, TakoVibe focuses on depth, clarity, and authenticity. Our goal is not to publish more, our goal is to publish meaningful engineering knowledge.
                        </p>
                        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 rounded-xl font-semibold">
                            <span>Quality > Quantity</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Core Values Section -->
        <section class="py-24 relative z-10 bg-gray-50/50 dark:bg-black/20">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
                <div class="text-center mb-16">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Our Core Values</h2>
                    <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-blue-600 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
                    {[
                        { title: "Quality over Quantity", desc: "Fewer articles, but deeply researched and thoughtfully written." },
                        { title: "Technical Accuracy", desc: "Content reviewed with real-world applicability in mind." },
                        { title: "Experience-Driven", desc: "We value lessons learned from building and maintaining systems." },
                        { title: "Open Knowledge", desc: "Engineering insights should be accessible, honest, and practical." }
                    ].map((value) => (
                        <div class="text-center p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#131B2E] border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3 text-lg">{value.title}</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">{value.desc}</p>
                        </div>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Topics Section -->
        <section class="py-24 relative z-10 border-y border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-end justify-between mb-12 gap-6">
                    <div class="max-w-2xl">
                        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">What We Write About</h2>
                        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                            TakoVibe covers topics that matter when software moves beyond tutorials.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                    {[
                        { label: "Backend Engineering & APIs", highlight: "Modern API Development", icon: "⚙️" },
                        { label: "Containers & DevOps", highlight: "Cloud-Native Infrastructure", icon: "🐳" },
                        { label: "Core Python Mastery", highlight: "Language Internals & Design", icon: "🐍" },
                        { label: "System Design & Architecture", highlight: "Scalability & Trade-offs", icon: "🏗️" },
                        { label: "Performance & Reliability", highlight: "Production-Grade Systems", icon: "⚡" },
